    description: "Two-finger gripper of the Seeed Studio reBot Arm B601-RS, driven by Intrinsic's pinch gripper realtime control service. In sim, the service drives Gazebo's simulated GPIO, which moves the fingers and holds grasped objects. Real-hardware support comes from Intrinsic."
